  <title>Profit / loss</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Financial</gui><gui>Profit /
  loss</gui></guiseq> lists every revenue account on one side and every
  expense account on the other, for the chosen <gui>Fiscal year</gui> (see
  <link xref="fiscal_years"/>). <gui>Income :</gui> is revenue less expenses.
  <gui>Refresh profit/loss</gui> reads the books again.</p>

  <p>Check <gui>Total</gui> on accounts to add up just those, in the total
  under each list: for instance, all sales accounts together. Checking a parent
  account counts it with everything under it.</p>

  <p>Each side has its own <gui>Report hub</gui>; see <link
  xref="report_hub"/>. Right click a list and choose <gui>Export to CSV</gui>
  to save it as a spreadsheet file.</p>

</page>
